{"seq":2,"slug":"agent-memory-context-state","title":"智能体记忆、上下文与状态管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/agentic-ai-engineering-systems/agent-core-architecture/agent-memory-context-state","wordCount":2968,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"智能体记忆-上下文与状态管理\">智能体记忆、上下文与状态管理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>上下文窗口</strong>：模型单次前向能接收的最大 token 数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，是记忆与状态的可见边界。</li>\n<li><strong>上下文工程</strong>：维护模型每一步所见状态集合的工程学科，区别于提示词措辞调优。</li>\n<li><strong>工作 / 会话 / 长期记忆</strong>：按生命周期切分的三层，分别对应任务内、会话内、跨会话三种保留时长。</li>\n<li><strong>权威来源</strong>（source of truth）：对某项世界事实唯一被承认的存储，Agent 的记忆只能是它的缓存。</li>\n<li><strong>渐进式披露</strong>（progressive disclosure）：上下文里只放检索句柄而非记忆正文，由模型按需展开。</li>\n<li><strong>幂等键</strong>（idempotency key）：写操作去重标识，保证重试不重复产生副作用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么无状态-llm-需要一套外置记忆系统\">为什么无状态 LLM 需要一套外置记忆系统</h2><p>把大模型直接包成一个循环，跑上二十轮工具调用，你会先撞到三个具体故障，而不是抽象的「缺乏记忆」。第一个是<strong>上下文腐坏</strong>：每轮的观察结果被原样追加，三万 token 的对话窗口在第七轮就被一段啰嗦的网页抓取文本塞满，模型开始丢失最初的任务约束。第二个是<strong>跨会话失忆</strong>：用户昨天已经确认过收货地址和报关口岸，今天重开对话框，一切从头再问——这在跨境电商客服、选品、合规审查这类长周期场景里是致命的。第三个是<strong>状态不一致</strong>：Agent 认为自己已经把订单 <code>A123</code> 改为已发货，但真正的事实源在订单服务数据库里，两者悄悄分叉，且没有任何一处记录分歧。</p>\n<p>这三个故障指向同一个根因：LLM 的推理是无状态的纯函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = f(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，它没有可写的内部状态；所谓「记忆」必须在模型外部，用工程手段构造一个读写层。2026 年业界把这件事统称为<strong>上下文工程</strong>（context engineering），以区别于早期的「提示词工程」。Anthropic 在 <em>Effective context engineering for AI agents</em>（<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/effective-context-engineering-for-ai-agents\">https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/effective-context-engineering-for-ai-agents</a> ）里给出的判断是：从「找对提示词措辞」转向「维护模型在每一步能看到的那个状态集合」，是 agent 工程最核心的转变。</p>\n<p>这一篇把记忆、上下文、状态三件事拆成可实现的部件。记忆回答「什么值得留下来」,上下文回答「此刻给模型看什么」,状态回答「哪一份是权威事实」。三者互为约束：记忆的写入策略决定了上下文预算怎么花，状态的权威边界决定了记忆能不能被信任。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上下文的有限预算是主要约束\">上下文的有限预算是主要约束</h2><p>现代模型的名义上下文窗口已经很大——Claude 的 200K 级别、Google Gemini 的百万级别都被公开宣称，但「能塞进去」和「该塞进去」是两回事。研究反复观察到的<strong>上下文腐坏</strong>（context rot）现象是：无关内容越多，模型对关键信息的召回越差，推理质量随填充率上升而单调下降（Chroma 的 <em>Context Rot</em> 技术报告，<a href=\"https://research.trychroma.com/context-rot\">https://research.trychroma.com/context-rot</a> ）。因此工程上要把上下文当作稀缺资源来分配，而不是当作免费货架。</p>\n<p>设上下文窗口总量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>（token），一次任务要分配给系统提示 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>、工具定义 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>、检索到的记忆 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>、历史轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>、当前观察 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span></span> 五块。约束是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><munder><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>o</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>总占用</mtext></munder><mo>≤</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>原始追加</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">compress</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>压缩累积</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\underbrace{s + t + r + h + o}_{\\text{总占用}} \\le B, \\qquad h_{i} = \\begin{cases} h_{i-1} + o_{i-1}, &amp; \\text{原始追加} \\\\ \\operatorname{compress}(h_{i-1}, o_{i-1}), &amp; \\text{压缩累积} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1041em;vertical-align:-1.4097em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.5903em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">总占用</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.2687em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7313em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4097em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">compress</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">原始追加</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">压缩累积</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>朴素实现走「原始追加」分支，占用线性增长，几轮就爆。主流做法有三条并行路线：<strong>滑动窗口</strong>只保留最近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 轮，简单但会丢掉早期关键约束；<strong>摘要压缩</strong>把老历史改写成自然语言摘要再拼回，是 agentic 系统在长任务里的标准动作；<strong>外部化</strong>把历史落成可检索的文件/数据库，只在上下文里放一个引用句柄（handle）。三条路线不互斥，生产系统通常同时用：近期滑动窗口保真，中期摘要压缩保连续，远期外部化存储保容量。判断依据是<strong>这一块信息下一次被需要的时间距离有多远</strong>——越远越应外部化。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  O[&quot;工具观察 / 用户输入&quot;] --&gt; R{&quot;是否值得写入长期记忆?&quot;}&#10;  R -- 否 --&gt; W[&quot;留在工作上下文中&lt;br/&gt;滑动窗口 + 摘要&quot;]&#10;  R -- 是 --&gt; E[&quot;抽取事实三元组&lt;br/&gt;实体·属性·值·时间戳&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; C{&quot;写入哪一层?&quot;}&#10;  C -- 短期 --&gt; S[&quot;会话状态存储&lt;br/&gt;会话结束即回收&quot;]&#10;  C -- 长期 --&gt; L[&quot;向量库 + 关系库&lt;br/&gt;跨会话可检索&quot;]&#10;  W --&gt; CTX[&quot;组装的上下文&lt;br/&gt;system + tools + memory + history&quot;]&#10;  L --&gt; RET[&quot;按查询检索 top-k&quot;]&#10;  RET --&gt; CTX&#10;  CTX --&gt; M[&quot;LLM 推理&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt; O\">graph TD\n  O[\"工具观察 / 用户输入\"] --&gt; R{\"是否值得写入长期记忆?\"}\n  R -- 否 --&gt; W[\"留在工作上下文中&lt;br/&gt;滑动窗口 + 摘要\"]\n  R -- 是 --&gt; E[\"抽取事实三元组&lt;br/&gt;实体·属性·值·时间戳\"]\n  E --&gt; C{\"写入哪一层?\"}\n  C -- 短期 --&gt; S[\"会话状态存储&lt;br/&gt;会话结束即回收\"]\n  C -- 长期 --&gt; L[\"向量库 + 关系库&lt;br/&gt;跨会话可检索\"]\n  W --&gt; CTX[\"组装的上下文&lt;br/&gt;system + tools + memory + history\"]\n  L --&gt; RET[\"按查询检索 top-k\"]\n  RET --&gt; CTX\n  CTX --&gt; M[\"LLM 推理\"]\n  M --&gt; O</pre><h2 id=\"记忆的三个层级与写入判据\">记忆的三个层级与写入判据</h2><p>把记忆分层是 2026 年的事实标准，但分层的方式各家不同。工程上最有用的切分是按<strong>生命周期</strong>分三层，因为生命周期决定了存储介质、检索方式和失效策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n<th>典型内容</th>\n<th>存储介质</th>\n<th>检索方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>工作记忆</td>\n<td>单任务/单轮</td>\n<td>当前观察、工具返回</td>\n<td>上下文本身</td>\n<td>直接可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话记忆</td>\n<td>单次会话</td>\n<td>任务约束、已确认参数</td>\n<td>会话状态存储（Redis）</td>\n<td>按会话 id 直取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长期记忆</td>\n<td>跨会话持久</td>\n<td>用户画像、历史决策</td>\n<td>向量库 + 关系库</td>\n<td>语义检索 + 结构化查询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>写入判据</strong>是这一层的核心难点：不是所有观察都值得持久化。一个可用的启发式是三维打分——<strong>新颖性</strong>（是否与已有记忆重复）、<strong>可复用性</strong>（未来任务是否会再用）、<strong>可信度</strong>（来源是用户确认还是模型猜的）。只有三个维度都过阈值的观察才写入长期记忆。这也是隐私设计的一条硬约束：记忆是用户数据的长期副本，写入前必须明确「存什么、存多久、谁能读」——把未确认的推断当作事实存进用户画像，是随后每一次检索都在放大的错误。</p>\n<p>一个关键区分：<strong>情景记忆</strong>（episodic，某次具体发生的事）和<strong>语义记忆</strong>（semantic，抽掉情境的稳定事实）应存在不同结构里。用户说「这次寄到深圳」是情景，随时可能变；「该用户默认收货地在深圳」是语义，需反复确认才成立。混在一张表里，会让一次性的临时偏好污染长期画像。</p>\n<h2 id=\"记忆检索-从相似度到时效衰减\">记忆检索：从相似度到时效衰减</h2><p>长期记忆的检索质量决定整条链路的成败。最朴素的实现是按余弦相似度取 top-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 向量，但生产系统很快会发现两个失效模式：一是<strong>时间无关</strong>——三年前的一次性地址和昨天的默认地址相似度可能一样高；二是<strong>过度检索</strong>——把不相关的十条记忆塞进上下文，触发前面说的上下文腐坏。</p>\n<p>工程上的修补是在相似度上叠加一个时效衰减项，形成一个综合打分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>q</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>相关性</mtext></munder><mo>⋅</mo><munder><munder><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>时效</mtext></munder><mo>⋅</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>使用频次</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(m, q) = \\underbrace{\\cos(\\vec{m}, \\vec{q})}_{\\text{相关性}} \\cdot \\underbrace{e^{-\\lambda \\Delta t}}_{\\text{时效}} \\cdot \\underbrace{u(m)}_{\\text{使用频次}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3263em;vertical-align:-1.5763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">相关性</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2355em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2254em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">时效</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3263em;vertical-align:-1.5763em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4237em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">使用频次</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 是记忆距今的时间（以天计），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 控制衰减速度——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，旧记忆衰减越快，适合偏好会快速漂移的场景（选品趋势）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 越小，稳定事实保留越久（合规口径）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是这条记忆被成功引用过的次数，用来强化被反复验证的记忆。</p>\n<p>2026 年一个明确的工程共识是<strong>不要把所有记忆塞进上下文</strong>。Anthropic 的做法是把长记忆当作可检索的外部资源，只在上下文里放少量高置信条目加上「需要更多可调用检索工具」的提示，让模型自己决定何时展开——即<strong>渐进式披露</strong>（progressive disclosure）：上下文里放指针，不放内容。对事实高度结构化的领域，更有效的是<strong>混合检索</strong>：先用关系查询精确过滤（某商家的所有历史报关记录），再在候选集内做语义排序，而不是对全库做向量检索。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态管理-权威来源与幂等写入\">状态管理：权威来源与幂等写入</h2><p>记忆存的是「我们记得什么」，状态存的是「事实是什么」。这两者必须严格分开，否则会得到前文说的状态不一致故障。状态管理的三条硬规则：</p>\n<p><strong>第一，指定唯一权威来源（source of truth）。</strong> 订单是否已发货，权威来源只能是订单服务的数据库，不能是 Agent 的对话历史。Agent 的记忆是缓存，缓存可以过期、可以重建，但绝不能反向覆盖权威来源。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，写操作必须走幂等接口。</strong> Agent 最容易犯的错是重试——工具调用超时后重发，结果同一笔退款执行了两次。所有从 Agent 发出的写操作都要带幂等键（idempotency key），服务端按键去重：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">apply</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>执行并记录 </mtext><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">∉</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">K</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>返回既有结果</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">K</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{apply}(k, \\Delta) = \\begin{cases} \\text{执行并记录 } k, &amp; k \\notin \\mathcal{K} \\\\ \\text{返回既有结果}, &amp; k \\in \\mathcal{K} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">apply</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">执行并记录</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">返回既有结果</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span></span><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"llap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0144em;\">K</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0144em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>第三，读操作要能识别陈旧。</strong> 每份缓存状态携带版本号或时间戳，Agent 决策前检查它是否落后于权威来源；落后则先刷新再行动。这就是<strong>读-改-写</strong>在高并发下必须用乐观锁的原因。</p>\n<p>把这些规则落成一个可检查的状态机，能显著降低「Agent 说做了但没做」的事故率：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;Agent 决定发起写操作&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;幂等键是否已存在?&quot;}&#10;  B -- 是 --&gt; C[&quot;返回历史结果&lt;br/&gt;不重复执行&quot;]&#10;  B -- 否 --&gt; D[&quot;乐观锁校验版本号&quot;]&#10;  D -- 版本落后 --&gt; E[&quot;刷新权威状态后重试&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; D&#10;  D -- 版本匹配 --&gt; F[&quot;提交事务并记录幂等键&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;更新本地缓存状态&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;写审计日志&lt;br/&gt;谁·何时·改了何字段&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"Agent 决定发起写操作\"] --&gt; B{\"幂等键是否已存在?\"}\n  B -- 是 --&gt; C[\"返回历史结果&lt;br/&gt;不重复执行\"]\n  B -- 否 --&gt; D[\"乐观锁校验版本号\"]\n  D -- 版本落后 --&gt; E[\"刷新权威状态后重试\"]\n  E --&gt; D\n  D -- 版本匹配 --&gt; F[\"提交事务并记录幂等键\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"更新本地缓存状态\"]\n  G --&gt; H[\"写审计日志&lt;br/&gt;谁·何时·改了何字段\"]</pre><h2 id=\"工程落地-把三件事拼成一条流水线\">工程落地：把三件事拼成一条流水线</h2><p>把记忆、上下文、状态缝合成一条可运维的流水线，需要固定的几个环节。<strong>组装</strong>：每轮把系统提示、可用工具、检索到的记忆、压缩后的历史、当前观察按固定顺序拼成上下文，顺序本身影响模型注意力，稳定优先。<strong>截断</strong>：设定各块的预算上限，超限时优先压缩历史、其次减少检索条目，绝不截断系统提示或安全约束。<strong>落盘</strong>：会话结束时把值得长期保留的事实抽取出来，写进长期记忆，并记录来源。<strong>审计</strong>：每一次影响权威状态的写操作留痕，便于回溯。</p>\n<p>几个 2026 年值得记住的量化经验：工具定义往往比预期更占预算，暴露几十个工具会吃掉上万 token 且降低选择准确率，应按任务阶段动态收窄工具集；检索条目数不是越多越好，多数场景 top-5 到 top-10 的边际收益转负；摘要压缩会引入信息损失，关键约束（金额、期限、法规条款）不应只存在于摘要里，而应结构化地放在独立的「不可压缩」区块。</p>\n<p>记忆系统的可信度最终由<strong>可验证性</strong>决定，而非召回率。一条被错误写入长期记忆的推断，会被每一次后续检索当成事实重申，错误随时间自我强化——这就是为什么写入判据里的「可信度」维度、以及状态管理里的「权威来源」规则，比任何检索算法调优都更重要。工程上宁可漏写，不可误写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>智能体记忆是三层生命周期（工作/会话/长期）加一套写入判据，配上有限的上下文预算分配；上下文工程承认窗口稀缺，用滑动窗口、摘要压缩、渐进式披露把钱花在离当前任务最近的信息上；状态管理用唯一权威来源、幂等写入、版本校验三条规则，保证 Agent 的记忆不与世界的事实分叉。三者中任何一环缺失，都会在长任务里以「失忆、串味、说谎」三种形式暴露出来。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"智能体记忆、上下文与状态管理","id":"智能体记忆-上下文与状态管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么无状态 LLM 需要一套外置记忆系统","id":"为什么无状态-llm-需要一套外置记忆系统"},{"level":2,"text":"上下文的有限预算是主要约束","id":"上下文的有限预算是主要约束"},{"level":2,"text":"记忆的三个层级与写入判据","id":"记忆的三个层级与写入判据"},{"level":2,"text":"记忆检索：从相似度到时效衰减","id":"记忆检索-从相似度到时效衰减"},{"level":2,"text":"状态管理：权威来源与幂等写入","id":"状态管理-权威来源与幂等写入"},{"level":2,"text":"工程落地：把三件事拼成一条流水线","id":"工程落地-把三件事拼成一条流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"智能体循环与推理架构（ReAct/规划-执行/反思）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/agentic-ai-engineering-systems/agent-core-architecture/agent-loop-reasoning-architecture"},"next":{"title":"工具调用契约与函数编排设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-frontier-research/agentic-ai-engineering-systems/agent-core-architecture/tool-use-function-calling-contract"}}